                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 3382/18.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Wilson to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">St. Josse Ten
                                Noode</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1909-12-17"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 17,
                    1909</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>The King of the Belgians died this morning. Sending appropriate expression on the
                    part of the President. The funeral most probably Wednesday.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
